---
model: googleai/gemini-1.5-pro
temperature: 0.7
maxOutputTokens: 2048

input:
  schema:
    text: string
    language?: string

output:
  format: json
  schema:
    type: object
    properties:
      translated:
        type: string
      confidence:
        type: number

tools:
  - detect_language
  - translate_text
---

Translate the following text to {{ language | default: "English" }}:

{{ text }}

Provide your translation in JSON format with the translated text and a confidence score.
